{
  "comment": [
    "One palette and scale, two pages, both built here: the panel compiles these into",
    "custom properties on its shadow host, and the trace replay page is built with the",
    "same properties inlined. Contrast ratios are asserted by tests/tokens.unit.test.ts,",
    "so a colour cannot be changed into an inaccessible one without a gate going red.",
    "Dark is defined outright, not derived by inversion."
  ],
  "scale": {
